=== PHASE 3/4/5 SUMMARY — 2026-11-21 (appended record) ===
TestRunner run 1 (2026-11-21T14:22Z, via `dotnet run`): HUNG and was killed after ~7.5 min.
It stopped after Phase2Tests.RiskClassifier_AppActions_ClassifiedFromArgs (78 PASS, 0 FAIL at that point)
and never reached Phase3Tests.CancelWhilePaused_ResultsInCancelledState_DoesNotHang. Cause (real bug, fixed):
AgentEngine.WaitIfPausedAsync blocked the CALLING thread on ManualResetEventSlim.Wait(ct), so a direct
caller of RunAsync could never reach the code that calls Resume()/Cancel() — a deadlock. (In the shipped app
it happened to work only because MainViewModel wraps RunAsync in Task.Run.) Fix: the pause gate is now a
truly async TaskCompletionSource gate (Pause swaps in a fresh uncompleted gate, Resume completes it,
WaitIfPausedAsync awaits it with the task token); AgentEngine.Dispose no longer touches the gate.
